  <article
    class="ws-case ws-mixo"
    id="work-mixo"
    aria-labelledby="mixo-heading"
  >
    <div class="ws-case-top">
      <span class="ws-eyebrow">01 / AI PRODUCT</span>
      <span class="ws-meta">
        Co-founder · Product, design &amp; engineering
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="ws-case-layout">
      <div class="ws-case-story">
        <a href="https://mixo.io" target="_blank">
          <Image src={MixoLogo} alt="Mixo Logo" class="w-32 mb-8" />
        </a>
        <h3 id="mixo-heading">
          Making AI <br />
          feel <span class="ws-underline">simple.</span>
        </h3>
        <p>
          I co-founded Mixo to help small businesses get online. My work
          connects the experience people use with the systems behind it: product
          direction, UX, frontend, backend, growth and support.{" "}
          <a
            class="ws-ref"
            href="#work-sources"
            data-open-sources
            aria-label="Source 1"
          >
            [1]
          </a>
        </p>
        <div class="ws-role-line">
          <span class="ws-dot"></span> <a href="https://mixo.io" target="_blank">https://mixo.io</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ws-tag-list" aria-label="Mixo experience">
          <span>AI-native UX</span>
          <span>Vue 3 + XState</span>
          <span>Product ownership</span>
        </div>
        <p class="ws-hand ws-story-note">make the powerful part feel simple.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ws-stage ws-mixo-stage">
        <div class="ws-stage-toolbar">
          <div class="ws-segment" role="tablist" aria-label="Mixo walkthrough">
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              id="mixo-tab-experience"
              aria-controls="mixo-experience"
              aria-selected="true"
              data-mixo-tab="experience"
            >
              <svg
                class="ws-icon  hidden sm:block"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.65"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="13" rx="2" />
                <path d="M12 16v5m-5 0h10" />
              </svg>{" "}
              The experience
            </button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              id="mixo-tab-system"
              aria-controls="mixo-system"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
              data-mixo-tab="system"
            >
              <svg
                class="ws-icon  hidden sm:block"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.65"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6m8-12 6 6-6 6M14 3l-4 18" />
              </svg>{" "}
              The system
            </button>
          </div>
          <button
            class="ws-icon-button ws-source-image !hidden md:!inline-grid"
            type="button"
            data-open-original
            aria-label="View original Mixo interface from the case study"
            title="View original Mixo interface"
          >
            <svg
              class="ws-icon"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.65"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M8 3H3v5m13-5h5v5M3 16v5h5m13-5v5h-5" />
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="ws-stage-content">
          <div
            id="mixo-experience"
            role="tabpanel"
            aria-labelledby="mixo-tab-experience"
            class="ws-mixo-experience"
          >
            <div class="ws-browser">
              <span class="ws-window-dots" aria-hidden="true">
                <i></i>
                <i></i>
                <i></i>
              </span>
              <span>
                <svg
                  class="ws-icon"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.65"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="11" rx="2" />
                  <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" />
                </svg>{" "}
                <a href="https://mixo.io" target="_blank">Mixo.io</a> / AI Website Builder
              </span>

            </div>
            <div class="ws-mixo-screen">
              <div class="ws-mixo-prompt" data-prompt>
                <a href="https://mixo.io" target="_blank">
                  <Image src={MixoLogo} alt="Mixo Logo" class="w-20 mb-4 mx-auto" />
                </a>
                <h4>Describe your business.</h4>
                <p class="ws-prompt-help">
                  Start with what you know. Let the product handle the website.
                </p>
                <div class="ws-prompt-box">
                  <p data-preset-prompt>
                    A recording studio for electronic artists. A place to turn
                    unfinished ideas into finished records.
                  </p>
                  <div class="ws-prompt-bottom">
                    Website brief{" "}
                    <span>
                      English{" "}
                      <svg
                        class="ws-icon"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="1.65"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                      >
                        <path d="m8 5 7 7-7 7" />
                      </svg>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="ws-preset-row">
                  <span>Example:</span>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    data-preset="studio"
                    aria-pressed="true"
                  >
                    Recording studio
                  </button>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    data-preset="bakery"
                    aria-pressed="false"
                  >
                    Neighbourhood bakery
                  </button>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="ws-generate" data-generate>
                  <svg
                    class="ws-icon"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.65"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <path d="m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5L12 3Z" />
                  </svg>{" "}
                  Preview a sample result{" "}
                  <svg
                    class="ws-icon"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.65"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                  </svg>
                </button>
                <p class="ws-demo-disclosure">
                  Preset example. No AI request or account needed.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="ws-mixo-result" data-result hidden>
                <div class="ws-result-bar">
                  <span>
                    <svg
                      class="ws-icon"
                      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.65"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                      <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" />
                    </svg>{" "}
                    A website to make your own
                  </span>
                  <button type="button" data-back-prompt>
                    Back to brief{" "}
                    <svg
                      class="ws-icon"
                      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.65"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                      <path d="M3 10a9 9 0 1 1 2 8M3 3v7h7" />
                    </svg>
                  </button>
                </div>
                <div class="ws-example-site" data-example-site>
                  <div class="ws-example-nav">
                    <b data-example-brand>North Loop.</b>
                    <span>Studio &nbsp; / &nbsp; Sessions</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ws-example-hero">
                    <div>
                      <span class="ws-example-kicker" data-example-kicker>
                        INDEPENDENT RECORDING STUDIO
                      </span>
                      <h4 data-example-title>
                        Finish the record
                        <br />
                        you started.
                      </h4>
                      <p data-example-description>
                        A space for electronic artists to record, experiment and
                        find their sound.
                      </p>
                      <span class="ws-example-cta" data-example-cta>
                        Find your session ↗
                      </span>
                    </div>
                    <svg
                      class="ws-example-art"
                      viewBox="0 0 200 230"
                      role="img"
                      aria-label="Abstract graphic for the example website"
                    >
                      <defs>
                        <pattern
                          id="ws-art-grid"
                          width="14"
                          height="14"
                          patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
                        >
                          <path
                            d="M14 0H0V14"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-opacity=".12"
                          />
                        </pattern>
                      </defs>
                      <rect
                        width="200"
                        height="230"
                        rx="4"
                        fill="url(#ws-art-grid)"
                      />
                      <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <circle cx="100" cy="115" r="75" />
                        <circle cx="100" cy="115" r="60" />
                        <circle cx="100" cy="115" r="45" />
                        <circle cx="100" cy="115" r="30" />
                        <circle cx="100" cy="115" r="15" />
                        <path d="M100 18v194M10 115h180" />
                      </g>
                      <circle cx="100" cy="115" r="5" fill="currentColor" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ws-example-sections">
                    <span>01 &nbsp; A place to create</span>
                    <span>02 &nbsp; Make it yours</span>
                    <span>03 &nbsp; Get in touch</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="ws-example-footer">
                  <span>Illustrative output, not a customer website.</span>
                  <button type="button" data-show-system>
                    See what sits underneath{" "}
                    <svg
                      class="ws-icon"
                      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.65"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                      <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                    </svg>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            id="mixo-system"
            role="tabpanel"
            aria-labelledby="mixo-tab-system"
            hidden
          >
            <div class="ws-system-intro">
              <span class="ws-eyebrow">SIMPLIFIED ARCHITECTURE</span>
              <h4>
                A small interface.
                <br />A much bigger system.
              </h4>
            </div>
            <div class="ws-system-map">
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 600 214"
                preserveAspectRatio="none"
                class="ws-system-wires"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path
                  d="M100 43H500M100 43V151H500V43M300 43V151"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#d7beb6"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                  stroke-dasharray="4 4"
                />
                <circle cx="300" cy="98" r="4" fill="#F90061" />
              </svg>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="ws-system-node"
                data-node="app"
                aria-pressed="true"
              >
                <svg
                  class="ws-icon"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.65"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="13" rx="2" />
                  <path d="M12 16v5m-5 0h10" />
                </svg>
                <b>Vue 3 + XState</b>
                <span>Application &amp; state</span>
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="ws-system-node"
                data-node="services"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <svg
                  class="ws-icon"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.65"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5L12 3Z" />
                </svg>
                <b>Node + AI providers</b>
                <span>Services &amp; integrations</span>
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="ws-system-node"
                data-node="sites"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <svg
                  class="ws-icon"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.65"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6m8-12 6 6-6 6M14 3l-4 18" />
                </svg>
                <b>Static-first sites</b>
                <span>HTML + selective Vue</span>
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="ws-system-node"
                data-node="delivery"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <svg
                  class="ws-icon"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.65"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                  <ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="4" ry="9" />
                  <path d="M3 12h18" />
                </svg>
                <b>GCP + Cloudflare</b>
                <span>Shared delivery</span>
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="ws-system-node"
                data-node="measure"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <svg
                  class="ws-icon"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.65"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="M9 6h12M9 12h12M9 18h12M3 6h1M3 12h1M3 18h1" />
                </svg>
                <b>Analytics + support</b>
                <span>Observe &amp; iterate</span>
              </button>
              <div class="ws-system-destination">
                <strong>3M+</strong>
                <span>
                  websites created
                  <br />
                  through Mixo
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ws-system-caption" aria-live="polite">
              <b data-node-title>The interface and the state behind it.</b>
              <p data-node-copy>
                I architected and built the Vue 3 application with XState, Vite,
                VueUse, FormKit and Tailwind CSS.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ws-stage-caption">
          <span class="ws-dot"></span>
          <span>Interactive reconstruction · sample content</span>
          <span class="ws-desktop-only">
            Try both views{" "}
            <svg
              class="ws-icon rotate-"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.65"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ws-metrics" aria-label="Reported Mixo platform outcomes">
      <div>
        <strong>500k</strong>
        <span>
          users within four months of launch{" "}
          <a
            class="ws-ref"
            href="#work-sources"
            data-open-sources
            aria-label="Source 1"
          >
            [1]
          </a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>750k+</strong>
        <span>
          businesses on the platform{" "}
          <a
            class="ws-ref"
            href="#work-sources"
            data-open-sources
            aria-label="Source 2"
          >
            [2]
          </a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>3M+</strong>
        <span>
          websites created through the platform{" "}
          <a
            class="ws-ref"
            href="#work-sources"
            data-open-sources
            aria-label="Source 2"
          >
            [2]
          </a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>2</strong>
        <span>
          founders scaling from 0 to 1.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ws-case-depth">
      <div class="ws-depth-intro">
        <span class="ws-eyebrow">THE WORK BEHIND THE RESULT</span>
        <h4>
          Simple on the surface. <br />
          Deliberate underneath.
        </h4>
        <p>
          Open a note for the decisions, implementation and responsibility
          behind the headline.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ws-notes">
        <details class="ws-note">
          <summary>
            <span>
              <small>PRODUCT & UX</small>
              <strong>More capability without more complication.</strong>
            </span>
            <svg
              class="ws-icon"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.65"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="ws-note-body">
            <p>
              Mixo grew from single landing pages to multi-page websites. I
              worked across strategy, UI/UX, growth and customer support, using
              where people got stuck to inform what we shipped next.
            </p>
            <p class="ws-note-detail">
              The design challenge: keep the path to a useful website
              understandable as the product becomes more capable.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="ws-note">
          <summary>
            <span>
              <small>DESIGN ENGINEERING</small>
              <strong>The interface and implementation were one job.</strong>
            </span>
            <svg
              class="ws-icon"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.65"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="ws-note-body">
            <p>
              I architected and built the Vue 3 application, including state
              modelling with XState. My work includes responsive templates,
              semantic markup, keyboard interaction and focus management.
            </p>
            <div class="ws-stack">
              <span>Vue 3</span>
              <span>XState</span>
              <span>Vite</span>
              <span>FormKit</span>
              <span>Tailwind</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="ws-note">
          <summary>
            <span>
              <small>SCALE & OWNERSHIP</small>
              <strong>
                A decision in one system reaches millions of sites.
              </strong>
            </span>
            <svg
              class="ws-icon"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.65"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="ws-note-body">
            <p>
              Generated sites use a static-first approach, with Vue hydrated
              where interaction is needed. I worked on image delivery, font and
              asset loading, backend services, billing and shared GCP /
              Cloudflare infrastructure.
            </p>
            <p class="ws-note-detail">
              The constraint: changes need to remain safe across many
              independently created customer websites.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ws-relevance">
      <span>WHAT I’D BRING TO MOISES</span>
      <p>
        AI-native UX, systems thinking and product decisions backed by the
        engineering to ship them.
      </p>

    </div>
  </article>

  <div class="ws-between">
    <span class="ws-hand">
      and then there’s the product I needed in my own studio&hellip;
    </span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 44 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path
        d="M8 4c-5 26 30 14 24 50m-8-7 8 10 9-8"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.7"
        stroke-linecap="round"
      />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <article
    class="ws-case ws-mixvisor"
    id="work-mixvisor"
    aria-labelledby="mixvisor-heading"
  >
    <div class="ws-case-top">
      <span class="ws-eyebrow">02 / MUSIC SOFTWARE</span>
      <span class="ws-meta">Solo design &amp; engineering · Tauri + Vue</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ws-case-layout">
