        <h3 id="mixvisor-heading">
          Built to help me <br />
          <span class="ws-underline">finish more music.</span>
        </h3>
        <p>
          I didn’t need another place to start an idea. I needed a better way to
          return to the ones I already had. Mixvisor grew out of that problem in
          my own studio.
        </p>
        <p>
          I designed and engineered the desktop app myself, using Tauri and Vue.
          It brings scattered sessions into one place, with the context to pick
          up where I left off.
